<title>SPAIN: Spain's CNMV okays Caja Rural Vacsa bid for Bankoa.</title>
<headline>Spain's CNMV okays Caja Rural Vacsa bid for Bankoa.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's stocks commission CNMV said on Monday it had authorised a bid by Sociedad Cooperativa de Credito Caja Rural Vasca to buy 100 percent of banking group Bankoa SA at 3,000 pesetas per share.</p>
<p>In the bid, Bankoa has excluded its 12.52 percent of the share capital from the offer, and it intends to reject the bid, CNMV said.</p>
<p>Caja Rural is also offering 8.0 billion pesetas in public debt as backing for the deal.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
</text>
